&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div id=&#34;gallery-b2b2852913a1d0a330f6c8e79bb65b1f&#34; class=&#34;gallery&#34;&gt;
  
  
    
    
&lt;figure class=&#34;grid-w50 pb-4 text-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://mis3085.github.io/docs-cartridgeweb/quality-photo1_7026034113540530986.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;생산에서의 품질 보증&#34; class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-full h-auto&#34;/&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;생산에서의 품질 보증&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
